+      "offset": 17997,
+      "length": 244,
+      "value": "\"Cannot convert a JavaScript function or symbol to a native value, because neither has a native representation. Remove it from the value before passing it to native code, or declare the native type as JavaScriptValue to receive it unconverted.\""
+    },
+    {
+      "filePath": "\/Users\/mac\/Desktop\/GTA_IV_APP\/node_modules\/expo-modules-jsi\/apple\/Sources\/ExpoModulesJSI\/Coding\/JavaScriptCodable+Any.swift",
+      "kind": "StringLiteral",
+      "offset": 18376,
+      "length": 298,
+      "value": "\"Cannot convert a typed array, ArrayBuffer or DataView to a free-form native value, because free-form values hold only primitives, plain objects, arrays and dates. Convert it to an array first (for example, with Array.from), or declare the native type as JavaScriptValue to receive it unconverted.\""
+    },
+    {
+      "filePath": "\/Users\/mac\/Desktop\/GTA_IV_APP\/node_modules\/expo-modules-jsi\/apple\/Sources\/ExpoModulesJSI\/Coding\/JavaScriptCodable+Any.swift",
+      "kind": "StringLiteral",
+      "offset": 18795,
+      "length": 212,
+      "value": "\"Cannot convert a WeakMap or WeakSet to a native value, because JavaScript doesn't allow reading their entries. Pass a Map or Set instead, or declare the native type as JavaScriptValue to receive it unconverted.\""
+    },
+    {
+      "filePath": "\/Users\/mac\/Desktop\/GTA_IV_APP\/node_modules\/expo-modules-jsi\/apple\/Sources\/ExpoModulesJSI\/Coding\/JavaScriptCodable+Any.swift",
+      "kind": "StringLiteral",
+      "offset": 19118,
+      "length": 304,
+      "value": "\"Cannot convert a Map with a key that isn't a string to a native value, because it decodes as a dictionary, whose keys are strings. Use only string keys, convert the Map to an array of entries first (for example, with Array.from), or declare the native type as JavaScriptValue to receive it unconverted.\""
+    },
+    {
+      "filePath": "\/Users\/mac\/Desktop\/GTA_IV_APP\/node_modules\/expo-modules-jsi\/apple\/Sources\/ExpoModulesJSI\/Coding\/JavaScriptCodable+Any.swift",
